        {"zh": "盯紧猎物，准备跳跃。", "en": "Locking onto prey, preparing to leap."},
        {"zh": "察觉到威胁，发出警告。", "en": "Noticing threat, issuing warning."},
        {"zh": "我的骨颈伸向你。", "en": "My bony neck reaches toward you."},
        {"zh": "长脖子压低，我要看清楚你。", "en": "Long neck lowered, let me see you clearly."},
        {"zh": "锁定敌方生物，准备战斗。", "en": "Locking on enemy, readying fight."},
